   "annotation_marker": "g",
   "annotation_type": "footnote",
   "annotation_text": "Patients on antiviral prophylaxis treatment or positive HBV antibodies should be tested for HBV-DNA ≤ 7 days prior to the start of C1D1 and +/- 72 hrs prior to D1 of each subsequent cycle to monitor for reactivation. See Table 5-4 for reactivation instructions.",
