   "annotation_type": "footnote",
   "annotation_text": "Tumor measurements may be made using physical examination, CT Scans or MRI. Tumor assessments will be performed every 12 weeks, +/- 1 week (every 3 months). Imaging will include chest and abdomen. Bone Scans and Brain CT/MRI may be performed as clinically indicated. Scans do not have to be repeated once disease progression is documented.",
